readsb (3.16.17) stable; urgency=medium

  * performance: relaxed memory order in threadpool atomics
  * performance: add CPU affinity pinning for decode thread
  * performance: lazy sendq compaction (avoid O(n) memmove on partial sends)
  * performance: receiver hash-table concurrency via recursive mutex
  * performance: parallel demodulation via threadpool (--decode-threads=N)
  * perf(test): test suites for affinity, threadpool, receiver, ring buffer,
    sprint helpers, and AGC gain statistics
  * fix: drainMessageBuffer lock safety for parallel worker contexts
  * fix: accumulate per-chunk gain stats after parallel demod
  * misc: add simple_drain flag to messageBuffer struct
  * misc: expose netDrainBuffer() for single-buffer draining

